    450  0430							; BuildStatus: rebuild the parts of the status line that changed (W_dirty).
    451  0430							; Cells (narrow 3x5 font, two characters per 8-pixel cell): 0-2 the score's
    452  0430							; last five digits (cell 2 holds one), 3 "W" + the wave's tens, 4 its ones;
    453  0430							; the sixth cell's bytes hold PF1: the batteries' two digits, in green.
    454  0430				   BuildStatus		; (one part per frame, to keep VBLANK short)
    455  0430					      SUBROUTINE
    456  0430		       ad e0 f0 	      lda	R_dirty	; game selection: the line reads GAME n
    457  0433		       29 20		      and	#$20
