   1464  2a79							; JetAct (X = a launched jet): four pixels right per update; every enemy on
   1465  2a79							; its shelf takes 10 damage as the nose passes its middle. Nose and middle
   1466  2a79							; close by at most 7 pixels an update, so each enemy is hit exactly once.
   1467  2a79				   JetAct
   1468  2a79					      SUBROUTINE
   1469  2a79		       86 b4		      stx	lt3
   1470  2a7b		       bd 80 f0 	      lda	R_eX,x
   1471  2a7e		       18		      clc
